<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="id"><head><%- include('../partials/head') %></head><body><%- include('../partials/header') %><section class="section page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Administrasi</p><h1 class="section-title">Restore Data</h1><p>Tempel isi file backup JSON yang dibuat SIPUS. Seluruh data file yang tersedia akan diganti.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap admin-form-wrap"><form class="admin-form" method="POST" action="/admin/backup/restore"><% if(error){ %><div class="form-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><label class="form-field form-field-wide"><span>Backup JSON</span><textarea name="backup" rows="22" required placeholder="Paste isi sipus-backup.json di sini..."></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin/laporan">Batal</a><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" onclick="return confirm('Restore akan mengganti data saat ini. Lanjutkan?');">Restore Data</button></div></form></div></section><%- include('../partials/footer') %></body></html>
